Multicore programming project for Computer Science Degree
A.Y. 2024/2025 Sapienza University of Rome

DNA sampling problem solved with bruteforce approach implemented in two different multicore solution.
One solution utilizes the OpenMP framework and the other one a combination of CUDA and MPI in order to maximise the parallelism through both CPU and GPU.
Inside the repository there is also a PDF explaining the work flow used and the results obtained.
